<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<ptxt>Outline</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>The new diagnosis system is a new diagnostic system designed for increasingly advanced and complex on-board electronic systems. The functions of this diagnostic system can be used with the TaSCAN diagnostic tool.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="D101407J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</step2>
</step1>
