<step1>
<ptxt>Action when an Error Occurs</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="D101514J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten3>
<ptxt>If the TaSCAN power indicator does not come on, or if not all of the system names that support diagnosis communication and diagnosis CAN communication are displayed on the menu, perform the following inspections and repair the malfunctioning area.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<step2>
<ptxt>TaSCAN power indicator does not come on</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="D100010J29" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<step3>
<ptxt>Connect TaSCAN to another vehicle and start TaSCAN.</ptxt>
